      "title": "Sound: a sound from a description with Stable Audio 3 Medium",
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "# Sound: a sound from a description with Stable Audio 3 Medium\n\nMakes stereo sound from a description, such as a sound effect, an ambience or a short piece of music, as long as the length you set. Built from Comfy's template audio_stable_audio_3_medium, without its Qwen rewrite of the description.\n\n## Models\n\n- [stable_audio_3_medium.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/stable-audio-3/resolve/main/checkpoints/stable_audio_3_medium.safetensors): Stable Audio 3 Medium, by Stability AI, [Stability AI Community License](https://stability.ai/community-license-agreement).\n- [t5gemma_b_b_ul2.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/stable-audio-3/resolve/main/text_encoders/t5gemma_b_b_ul2.safetensors): the T5Gemma text encoder Stable Audio 3 ships with, [Stability AI Community License](https://stability.ai/community-license-agreement).\n\n## Inputs\n\n- Description: the text of node 6.\n- Length: the seconds of node 11.\n- Seed: the seed of node 3."
